          "say": "Dividing: subtract them. 2 to the seven over 2 cubed is 2 to the four.",
          "write": "2⁷ ÷ 2³ = 2⁴ = 16"
        },
        {
          "say": "Power of a power: multiply. 5 squared, cubed, is 5 to the six.",
          "write": "(5²)³ = 5⁶"
        },
        {
          "say": "5 cubed over 5 cubed is 1. So any number to the zero is 1.",
          "write": "a⁰ = 1"
        },
        {
          "say": "The bases must match. 2 cubed times 3 squared won't combine.",
          "write": "2³ × 3²: no"
        }
      ]
