              {
                "kind": "arrow",
                "x": 185,
                "y": 95,
                "x2": 220,
                "y2": 60,
                "color": "purple"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "The cycle has 4 steps. 7 to the ten matches 7 squared, ending in 9.",
          "write": "7¹⁰ ends in 9"
        },
        {
          "say": "Indices come before times and divide. That's the I in BIDMAS.",
          "write": "2³ + 4² × 3"
        },
        {
          "say": "8 plus 16 times 3. That's 8 plus 48, which is 56.",
          "write": "= 8 + 48 = 56"
        }
      ]
